      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Core:** `promotion_v1` | **Evaluation Methodology:** `Descriptive Window Comparison (Pre vs During vs Post)`\n**Scope:** 3 promotional discount events evaluated across 2,880 SKU-store exposures.\n> \u26a0\ufe0f **Observational Caveat:** The evaluation employs descriptive window comparisons without counterfactual synthetic controls. Unobserved seasonal shocks, competitor actions, and stockouts are not causally isolated."
      }
